 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【比赛战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-26/match1985083date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">首次从德甲降级！十人狼堡1-2遭帕德博恩逆转 库尔达加时赛制胜</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260526/zhanbao_image_1985083_1779741966_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260526/zhanbao_image_1985083_1779741966_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260526/zhanbao_image_1985083_1779741966_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>德甲升降级附加赛次回合，沃尔夫斯堡客场1-2遭帕德博恩逆转，梅勒染红，双方常规时间战平，加时赛库尔达制胜。帕德博恩成功升级将征战下赛季德甲，狼堡队史首次从德甲降级。</p><p><strong>【热门新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-26/6a147627b888bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">大变革！米兰官方：阿莱格里下课，富拉尼、塔雷、蒙卡达离职</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/202605260038212636.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/202605260038212636.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/202605260038212636.jpg"> </div><p>米兰官方公告，主帅阿莱格里、俱乐部总监塔雷、CEO富拉尼、技术总监蒙卡达全部离职。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-26/6a147e249c7bbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">动荡！阿莱格里和管理层全被解雇，米兰连续3位主帅带队不到一年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/202605260052026259.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/202605260052026259_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/202605260052026259_720.jpg"> </div><p>阿莱格里去年5月30日出任米兰主帅，7月1日正式带队，执教不到一年便下课。自皮奥利下课后，米兰连续三位主帅带队不到一年被解雇，此前孔塞桑和丰塞卡均只执教了182天。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-26/6a14c6dce75f6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：梅西左腿腘绳肌因肌肉疲劳出现负荷劳损，复出时间待定</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.46" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/202605260624007023.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.46" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.46" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/202605260624007023_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/202605260624007023_720.jpg"> </div><p>迈阿密国际官方发布伤情通报，梅西左腿腘绳肌因肌肉疲劳出现负荷劳损，复出时间视恢复情况而定。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-26/6a146aa6d7a7cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">哥伦比亚世界杯名单：迪亚斯、J罗领衔，奥斯皮纳、穆尼奥斯在列</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260525/6a147003ebde7.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260525/6a147003ebde7.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260525/6a147003ebde7.jpg"> </div><p>哥伦比亚队公布参加美加墨世界杯的大名单。迪亚斯、J罗领衔，奥斯皮纳、丹尼尔·穆尼奥斯、金特罗、达文森・桑切斯、库乔在列。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-26/6a14af63347a4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">队史首次从德甲降级！狼堡降入德乙，连续29个赛季出战德甲遭终结</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.48" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/6a14afc639ce9_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.48" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.48" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/6a14afc639ce9_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/6a14afc639ce9_720.jpg"> </div><p>德甲升降级附加赛次回合，沃尔夫斯堡加时1-2不敌帕德博恩，队史首次从德甲降级。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-26/6a14b7d070bdfnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">有大鱼？里克尔梅：已经为皇马敲定两名世界级球星；两周内公布</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/202605260513181048.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/202605260513181048_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260526/202605260513181048_720.jpg"> </div><p>企业家里克尔梅正式宣布参选皇马主席，成为二十年来弗洛伦蒂诺在主席选举中迎来的首位竞争对手。他接受了《ABC报》的专访，在体育竞技层面，这位候选人抛出了自己最核心的竞选承诺。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-26/6a14c46aeb498native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿斯：穆帅的700万解约金今天到期，皇马之后想请他需付1500万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu